# Copy to .leakcheck-terms (gitignored — NEVER commit the real one).
# One case-insensitive term per line; '#' starts a comment. Anything matching
# in an outgoing diff, commit message, PR title or PR body blocks the push.
#
# Put here what you would not want a stranger to learn from a public repo:
#   your home / nearest station names, your street or building, your SSID,
#   your employer, family names, the exact lines you commute on.
#
# your-station-name
# your-street
# your-home-wifi-ssid
